    "body": "FF9 already shows a card icon when the player is next to someone they can play Tetra Master with. Make that prompt glow, or otherwise read differently, when the player has not yet beaten that opponent — so a card hunt does not require remembering who is already cleared.\n\nScope notes:\n- FF9 script work (Memoria), not editor work.\n- Needs per-opponent \"has been beaten\" state; check whether the game already tracks it before adding storage.\n- Keep the normal prompt appearance for opponents already beaten.\n\nDeferred from a UI session as engine work; not a priority right now.",
